OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water appoints new     
OL,4,Anon-executive chair                    
OL,6,FSouth East Water (SEW) has appointed a 
OL,7,Fnew independent non-executive chair as 
OL,8,Fit looks to rebuild trust with         
OL,9,Fcustomers.                             
OL,11,FThe firm said Richard Morse would bring
OL,12,Fmore than 40 years of experience in    
OL,13,Finfrastructure, investment and         
OL,14,Fregulation to the role when he started 
OL,15,Fon 3 December.                         
OL,17,FSEW boss John Halsall pledged to make  
OL,18,Fchanges to improve the company when he 
OL,19,Fjoined in July, but a report from      
OL,20,Fregulators in October said SEW was the 
OL,21,Fworst in the industry for supply       
OL,22,Fissues.                                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
